# Local social-pilot credentials. The file-backed TokenStore that wrote these
# is gone (Pb4e17 deleted the API publish pipeline), so nothing creates them
# any more — but the pilot's GCP project and Meta app are deliberately left
# dormant rather than torn down, so keep ignoring these in case a stray
# plaintext token file from that setup is still around. NEVER commit one.
content/social/tokens.local.json
content/social/tokens.*.json
